ant to write a song  for them I want to be able to bless them  in a way that can do a little bit of  what they did for me  [Music]  [Applause]  what does being Latino mean to you being  latina means being strong and courageous  and I think the number one thing is  passionate we want people to come into  our homes and feel like it's it's their  home we have such beautiful culture with  our music with our dancing with our food  I am so thankful that I am latina Kym's  when I'm with you I want to know making  this video do you remember making this  video I do look at me trying to play my  good time not even playing it right oh  my god well they're mine today at 25  when you watch Sally here I can't  believe it for that girl who was in her  bedroom making songs and trying to make  something happen so so so much do you  think this girl in her bedroom ever  thought she'd be in one of the most  successful groups of all time look I  told that girl she would not believe  [Music]  in 2012 then eighteen-year-old Ali took  a chance in audition for The X Factor  [Music]  it didn't work out for Ali as a soloist  but the judges gave her another shot  this time in a group are you gonna stand  over there with the girls you are all  look at that as you are invited to the  judges paper they went on to become  fifth harmony  looking back on the x-factor would you  say that was a positive experience the  x-factor was a positive experience to an  extent but I learned a lot Ally got  candid about navigating the highs and  lows being a group was incredible but so  many opinions happened and like so much  judgment who was it coming from feel  like everybody I kind of let the  opinions overtake me and I kind of felt  like I needed to step back and like  really be mindful of who I was and what  I did and even songwriting like it was  hard to really do that in a group  because there's so many opinions for a  little bit you kind of think I'm not  like good enough that people put you in  a box and everybody had their own like  role but I didn't want to fit a role  like I wanted to just be myself so that  was just sad  I just really heartbroken you know I  mean I know probably everyone felt that  way in a way for sure but like you know  everyone has their own experience but I  just felt like it's the worst when you  feel like you can't be yourself you're  not even seen for yourself  fifth harmony announced an indefinite  hiatus in March  is there any chance is there any  conversation about revisiting the group  and making music together again possibly  in the future you know what you never  know what can happen yeah you're living  the door open I would say leave we're  all probably leaving the door open okay  which means it's time for Ally to get  back to her original plan as a solo  artist  [Music]  congratulations you're officially  assigned solo artists thank you Oh how  does that feel to even like hear that  out loud  dang it's incredible everything I went  through all the ups and downs I'm a  signed artist I feel like I'm living a  new life now is this the rebirth of  alley Brook yes I would definitely say  it's the rebirth of alley broke Who I am  someone to you who looks a little hotter  someone there who ain't afraid to take  it farther  I'm truly back to who who I was I just  kind of imagine me now and then that  twelve year old me  kind of like meeting and like we're  hugging and embracing and I guess I  found you  what are you discovering about yourself  when it comes to music right about what  I want to write about sing it what I  want to sing about I'm also like doing  things that kind of surprised me too  vocally and pushing myself you know even  fashion is so important to me you've  been expressing myself in you know  wearing what I want to wear and there's  no one telling you what you can or can't  do anyway yeah yeah they're your own  boss yeah it's a beautiful journey  oh I wanna stay I wanna do  [Music]  Alley is still in the early stages